Today is Tuesday.
It is now half past five in the evening.
I go to the gym.
I always go there on Tuesdays and Thursdays.
There are many people in the gym.
I put down my bag.
I start my exercise.
I do not go to the gym every day.
I go only two days.
But I always go on time.
First, I run on the machine.
I run for thirty minutes.
Sometimes I lift weights.
Today I only run.
Now I am tired.
But I am very happy.
This is my new routine.
I always follow it.
I return home at half past six.
Now I feel very good.
